  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"To commemorate the first 10 years I have lived in New York City, I decided to publish a series of three books in homage to my new hometown. The first one, Every coffee I drank in January 2010, pays tribute to one of New York's greatest feats: the corner deli drip coffee. Chronicling my coffee intake over one month, I collected the coffee cup lids of each consumed coffee. The lid becomes a white canvas, with the coffee stain revealing an unique pattern of use." --Artist's statement.</subfield>
  </datafield>
